    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A relic. That's a cold way to put it, even if it's accurate. I suppose there is a certain dignity in admitting when the era is over. But it's the staying that feels so heavy... the sheer repetitive weight of every day that follows the peak. What is the purpose of lingering when the substance of your life has already been written and archived?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
